      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KITTYKAT CUTIE (2) draws better than in the last two outings and had recorded a series of top-two results prior. Led to win easily here three back so has the speed to take advantage of this barrier. SPLASH OF PAYNT (8) took full advantage of the inside draw for a dominant win when resuming at this circuit and distance last time out. Can settle just behind them and wait on the sprint lane so could go on with it. MISS OUT (11) was let down by manners last start but has trialled well since. If she gets it right she is good enough to be competitive. BETTOR LOVER NZ (1) draws much better than last start and is worth some thought based on his victory here two back.",
